in verification-nat

"
定理2 [_+_ の可換則 (comm+)]
X + Y = Y + X
定理2の証明. Xに着目して構造的帰納法を用いる.

I. Base case
W2S: 0 + Y = Y + 0
→ 補題1: X + 0 = X の証明が必要

II. Induction case
IH: X + Y = Y + X
W2S: s(X) + Y = Y + s(X)
→ 補題2: X + s(Y) = s(X + Y) の証明が必要
"


"
補題1: X + 0 = X
補題1の証明. Xに着目して構造的帰納法を用いる.
"

"I. Base case"
open PNAT1 .
  -- check
  red 0 + 0 = 0 .
close

"II. Induction case"
open PNAT1 .
  -- fresh constants
  op x : -> PNat .
  -- IH
  eq x + 0 = x .
  -- check
  red s(x) + 0 = s(x) .
close

"補題1の証明終了"


"
補題2: X + s(Y) = s(X + Y)
補題2の証明. Xに着目して構造的帰納法を用いる.
"

"I. Base case"
open PNAT1 .
  -- fresh constants
  op y : -> PNat .
  -- check
  red 0 + s(y) = s(0 + y) .
close

"II. Induction case"
open PNAT1 .
  -- fresh constants
  ops x y : -> PNat .
  -- IH
  eq x + s(Y) = s(x + Y) .
  -- check
  red s(x) + s(y) = s(s(x) + y) .
close

"補題2の証明終了"


"
定理2 [_+_ の可換則 (comm+)]
X + Y = Y + X
定理2の証明. Xに着目して構造的帰納法を用いる.
"

"I. Base case"
open PNAT1 .
  -- fresh constants
  op y : -> PNat .
  -- 補題1
  eq X + 0 = X . -- (rz+)
  -- check
  red 0 + y = y + 0 .
close

"II. Induction case"
open PNAT1 .
  -- fresh constants
  ops x y : -> PNat .
  -- 補題2
  eq X + s(Y) = s(X + Y) . -- (rs+)
  -- IH
  eq x + Y = Y + x .
  -- check
  red s(x) + y = y + s(x) .
close

"定理2の証明終了"